      "message": "I think you can get rid of all of the `skip_phis` logic if you just change this to:\n```\nauto cont_blk \u003d NewBlock(Label(loop-\u003eContinuing()));\nEmitIncomingPhis(loop-\u003eContinuing());\nblocks_to_emit_.push_back({cont_blk, loop-\u003eContinuing()});\n```\n\nThat also keeps all of the logic for incoming phis in `EmitLoop`, which is kinda nice.",
